          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Perceptyne Builds AI-Powered Dual-Arm Robots for India's Factory Floors With Flexible Low-Cost Deployment",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "Indian startup Perceptyne is developing AI-driven dual-arm robotic systems designed to automate complex manufacturing tasks that traditional industrial robots cannot perform cost-effectively. The company positions its robots as flexible and affordable enough for mid-sized Indian factories, aiming to reduce the barrier to automation that has historically kept smaller manufacturers from deploying robotics. The startup enters a manufacturing sector where AI-driven automation is increasingly reshaping the nature of factory work across India.",
            "url": "https://yourstory.com/2026/04/perceptyne-robots-factory-automation",
            "publisher": {
